# NOTE: no Android section, because there is no Android directory. Android is on
# hold (ADR-0137 성재 결정 6) and `expo prebuild` must never run here — one run
# without `--platform android` regenerates ios/ and deletes the NSE target that
# 이행 순서 5 attaches. `__tests__/projectShape.test.ts` fails if that changes.

# Output of `scripts/measure.sh`. The committed evidence lives in
# `measure/captures/`; this directory is scratch and is regenerated per run.
measure/out/
